url":"https://github.com/atmosfaere","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmosfaere/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T20:27:33Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T20:27:33Z","body":"Thanks for the comments, I'll go ahead and close this. I do think it would be convenient to keep the resources shared until one is edited, causing a new texture to be created. I might submit a proposal in the future if I still think this is a good idea after some more thinking about it. \n\nThings work the way they are now, but maybe the interface design could be improved to be more intuitive (not having to select make unique which is somewhat hidden) and the behavior of sprites created by copy and paste having \"hidden\" linking of resources. This is something I definitely didn't expect for a simple gradient.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558231654/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]